    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0156" n="144" xml:id="pg144"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.00/8–1845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-18T16:00:00+02:00">August 18, 1945—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 7:11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5003. Bidault told me last night orally that the French Govt was agreeable to the
                    Tripartite action mentioned in paragraph 4 Dept’s 3754, August 9, 1 p.m.<anchor
                        n="93" xml:id="d96-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d96-f1" n="93" xml:id="d96-f1-content">
                <p>Same as telegram 6704 on same date to London, <ref target="#pg134">p.
                    134</ref>.</p>
            </note>
